# One wait advances every prepared vessel; experimental controls share elapsed time
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL @ 25C
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.79g @ 25C
add v1 HCl 0.002mol @ 25C
new
add v2 water 100mL @ 35C
add v2 Na2S2O3 0.79g @ 35C
add v2 HCl 0.002mol @ 35C
wait 20s
look v1
look v2
wait 20s
look v1
look v2
inspect
